stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Running : Submit
  Running --> Approved : 末节点通过
  Running --> Rejected : 任一节点拒绝
  Running --> Returned : ReturnToInitiator
  Running --> Withdrawn : Withdraw
  Running --> Terminated : Terminate(管理员)
  Running --> Running : Approve 推进下一节点 / ReturnToPrevious / Transfer / AddSign / AutoPass
  Returned --> Running : Resubmit（回到第一节点）
  Returned --> Withdrawn : Withdraw
  Approved --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Withdrawn --> [*]
  Terminated --> [*]
